Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.80,0:01:04.30,Title,0,0,0,0,,《寂静岭2：启示》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.21,0:02:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打不赢我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cannot defeat me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.63,0:02:54.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要去寂静岭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not go to Silent Hill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.99,0:03:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, it's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.08,0:03:31.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,有我在呢…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.34,0:03:34.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.04,0:03:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 火在烧我… - 没事的 孩子 一个噩梦而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I was burning… - Hey come on, kiddo, it was just a dream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.71,0:03:43.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次搬家后你都会做噩梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like this morning…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.07,0:03:48.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这次感觉不一样 - 听我说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This feels different… - Hey look…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.85,0:03:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来把东西规整好 把房子粉刷一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once we've unpacked and give this place a lick of paint…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.22,0:03:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像自己的家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This will be our home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.29,0:03:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 噩梦会逐渐消淡 - 他们在叫我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The dreams will fade. - They're calling me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.00,0:04:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,别听他们说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not listen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.96,0:04:07.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要听 你听他们的话了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not listen. Do you hear?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.04,0:04:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,答应我 不管如何 不要去那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to promise me that whatever happens, you'll never go there…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.72,0:04:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.68,0:04:46.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,又做噩梦了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rough night?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.63,0:04:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.52,0:04:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 我不想再搬家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy, I don't want to do this again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.00,0:04:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, honey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.01,0:04:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,没拿勺…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spoons…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.32,0:05:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,「茜瑟」 为什么叫茜瑟？\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Heather." Why Heather?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.98,0:05:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我奶奶的名字 你要是不喜欢就自己改一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was my grandmother's name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.33,0:05:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.47,0:05:14.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫茜瑟挺好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heather is fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.36,0:05:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫过莎伦 玛丽 然后叫凯西 现在叫茜瑟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was Sharon, then Mary, then Cathy. Now Heather.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.97,0:05:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你原来叫克里斯多佛 现在叫哈利\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you were Christopher and now you're Harry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.54,0:05:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,名字又没多大用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Names don't matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.70,0:05:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm still me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.34,0:05:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,生日快乐！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happy birthday!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.82,0:05:44.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爸 谢谢你！但是你送早了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, thank you! But you're, you're early.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.52,0:05:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,是有点早\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a little.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.70,0:05:49.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,真高兴 我女儿马上都要成年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't believe that today I have a soon-to-be 18 year-old daughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.51,0:06:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了？- 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's wrong? - Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.63,0:06:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺喜欢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.67,0:06:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的？- 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Really? - Yes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.77,0:06:09.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你在商场盯着看的那件\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is the one I saw you're looking at in the mall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.27,0:06:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 谢谢 我喜欢这件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, yes. Thank you. I love it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.25,0:06:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用谢 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're welcome, honey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.28,0:06:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这的头发都白了 老爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're getting all that gray there, dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.06,0:06:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是你的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmmm, your fault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.74,0:06:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你看 你染得颜色都掉了 - 知道了 我去弄一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know, yours are showing. - Yeah, I know. I'll fix it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.90,0:06:33.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得咱们在这地方挺好的 你觉得呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think this place will be good for us, you know? What do you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.79,0:06:35.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.60,0:06:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,开心点 我们规整下东西 把新房子粉刷下怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, come on. What's say we unpacked, give the new place a lick of paint…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.11,0:06:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想… - 别 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I think… - Don't, Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.05,0:06:46.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.63,0:06:52.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我梦里你说了刚才说的话 所以 别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just what you said in my dream. Just, don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.20,0:06:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.16,0:06:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,上学第一天我不想迟到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not want to be late on the first day of school.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.84,0:07:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,要记得规矩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, remember the rules.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.72,0:07:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 新城市 新学校 - 明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}- New town, new school. - Yes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.79,0:07:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前我就这么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've done this before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.38,0:07:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 只是有点…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you have, I'm just…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.94,0:07:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有点担心 - 别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know I worry. - Don't worry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.79,0:07:16.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很小心的 没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm careful. I'll be fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.06,0:07:19.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱你爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.95,0:07:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也爱你 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you too, honey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.66,0:08:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,露丝 多希望你还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Rose. I wish you were still here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.60,0:08:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,从你把莎伦带回来 日子真的很艰辛\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been so hard since you brought Sharon back to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.79,0:08:22.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,克里斯多佛 我的爱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Christopher, my love, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.00,0:08:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,露丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rose{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.35,0:08:29.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried to find you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.03,0:08:32.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,找了很久很久\N{\fnArial\fs30}I searched for so long{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.22,0:08:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的爱人啊 我的时间不多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My love, I don't have a lot of time{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.39,0:08:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被困在这了 你什么都帮不了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trapped here. There's nothing you can do for me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.20,0:08:40.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护好女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}protect her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.62,0:08:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她现在是最重要的 - 你为什么回不来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's the one that matters now. - Why can't you come back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.62,0:08:49.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发现了标记 遗失的那部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found a Seal. Part of it is missing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.65,0:08:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有我们中的一个可以脱险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only one of us could come through.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.81,0:08:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做了选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made a choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.19,0:08:58.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们的女儿在哪？- 他们会去寻找她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where is our daughter? - They'll come looking for her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.47,0:09:02.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会去找她因为他们需要她\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll come looking because they need her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.30,0:09:05.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让他们把她带走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never let them take her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.09,0:09:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,向我发誓 无论发生什么 无论你做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter what happens, no matter what you have to do, swear to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.73,0:09:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,向我发誓你不会让他们带走她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Swear to me you will never let them take her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.53,0:09:14.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我发誓 - 我会把她带回你身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I swear. - I brought her back to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.87,0:09:16.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,她现在是你最需关心的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is yours to care for now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.52,0:09:18.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,别走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.22,0:09:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见了 我的爱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye, my love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.25,0:09:26.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,露丝！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rose!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.94,0:09:31.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.49,0:09:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎伦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sharon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.16,0:09:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我的天 莎伦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God, Sharon!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.51,0:09:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在这 - 爸爸！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You are here. - Daddy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.03,0:09:45.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.62,0:09:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在安全了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are safe now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.24,0:09:51.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了什么事？我什么都不记得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened? I don't remember anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.42,0:09:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了 没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.84,0:09:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.82,0:09:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你发生了意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were in an accident.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.20,0:10:00.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那妈妈呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Mommy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.08,0:10:05.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是妈妈救了你 - 妈妈呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mommy saved you. - Where's Mommy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.54,0:10:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,她走了 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's gone, honey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.61,0:11:04.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我并不是故意想吓你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. I didn't mean to scare you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.32,0:11:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对不起 说什么？- 你没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry, what? - Are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.92,0:11:11.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I'm fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.85,0:11:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该不想被流浪汉骚扰吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just that you don't wanna be messing with the vagrants, miss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.70,0:11:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想看看他是不是需要帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanted to see if he needed some help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.99,0:11:19.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些人超出了我们帮助的范围\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some people are beyond our help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.91,0:11:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们见过么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have we met?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.30,0:11:28.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 不 我想没见过 - 没有？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, no, I don't think so. - No?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.69,0:11:31.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很确定见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure we have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.10,0:11:34.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你叫什么名字？- 我得去赶车了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is your name? - I have to catch my bus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.43,0:11:43.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎回来 希望你们过了个愉快的圣诞假期\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome back, everyone. I hope you had a good Christmas vacation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.11,0:11:47.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,高兴这学期有新同学加入我们班级\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would like to welcome some new students who will be joining us this semester.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.08,0:11:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,茜瑟·曼森 能向大家打声招呼吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heather Mason. Could you say hello to the class, Heather?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.68,0:11:53.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家好 我是茜瑟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. I'm Heather.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.55,0:11:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚搬来镇上 所以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm new. I just moved to town, so…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.41,0:12:00.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,大方点 茜瑟 向大家介绍下自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Heather, share a little bit of yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.81,0:12:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人都有故事 和大家说说你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone has a story. Tell us yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.24,0:12:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么 还是小学三年级吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this, third grade?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.37,0:12:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们想知道什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you wanna know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.41,0:12:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的衣服都是从旧衣店买的么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you get all of your clothes from goodwill?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.90,0:12:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 知道吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, you know what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.79,0:12:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你们好好的讲讲吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me make this sincere for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.26,0:12:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是11岁以来 我换的第5所学校了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the fifth school I've been to since I was 11.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.68,0:12:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和我爸一直搬家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me and my dad, we move around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.39,0:12:30.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,经历多了 见怪不怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I do this, a lot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.57,0:12:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以别想着记住我的名字 因为我很确定我不会记住你们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So don't bother trying to remember my name because I'm sure as hell not gonna remember yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.28,0:12:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要和我说话 我们不会成为朋友的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not talk to me. We won't be friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.39,0:12:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会加你的I.M 或者Facebook Twitter\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't I.M you or, Facebook you or Tweet you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.79,0:12:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,浏览你的博客\N{\fnArial\fs30}read your blog.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.12,0:12:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论你想说什么 做什么 别麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And whatever you're thinking of saying or doing, don't bother, because{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.00,0:12:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我见得多了 依我看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen it before, and I'm just guessing here, but…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.51,0:12:58.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我并不觉得这屋里有多少有想法的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think there are too many original thinkers in this room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.51,0:13:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你们有人发现我的一些值得注意的事的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}And by the time any of you have found{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.95,0:13:05.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经搬走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have moved on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.25,0:13:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 行了吧？- 不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How's that? - Very impressive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.97,0:13:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们班还有另一位新同学…文森特·库普\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now the next addition to our class, … Vincent Cooper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.75,0:13:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在耍我么？我都不懂你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you kidding me? I can't follow that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.99,0:13:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.73,0:13:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,烧死女巫！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burn the witch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.14,0:13:54.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 烧死女巫！- 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Burn the witch! - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.25,0:13:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 烧死女巫！- 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Burn the witch! - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.80,0:13:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 放开我 - 烧死女巫！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Please leave me alone. - Burn the Witch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.64,0:14:01.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你们了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.50,0:14:02.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave me alone…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.50,0:15:09.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you alright?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.03,0:15:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 你还好么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.35,0:15:21.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在教室外面干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing out of class?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.11,0:15:24.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我迷路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? I'm lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.53,0:15:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,找不到数学教室了 知道在哪吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't find Math. Any ideas?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.20,0:15:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.81,0:15:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也找不到路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…I'm lost too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.95,0:15:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 能一起喝咖啡吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey look, you wanna get a coffee?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.25,0:15:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不了 我还有课 - 我是说 过会\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, we have class. - I mean, later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.80,0:15:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不了 - 为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Why not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.05,0:15:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都是新来的 我们都不认识其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're both new. We don't know anyone else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.60,0:15:51.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在班上讲的那些话 是有原因的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That speech I gave in class, I gave it for a reason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.57,0:15:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确实不想认识这里的任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really do not want to know anyone here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.63,0:16:33.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 今天怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, honey. How was your day?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.47,0:16:36.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得有人在跟踪我 该怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think there's someone following me. What do I do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.26,0:16:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 啊…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Uhh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.49,0:16:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,暂时先别回来 我们在别的地方碰面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't come back here. Not yet. I'll meet you somewhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.28,0:16:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,中央广场百货\N{\fnArial\fs30}Central Square Mall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.48,0:16:50.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你确定下地点 - 好的 在快乐汉堡那见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You need to make sure. - OK, I'll be the Happy-Hamburg place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.34,0:16:55.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会尽快到那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be there as soon as I can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.39,0:16:57.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得有别人知道这事吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think someone knows?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.49,0:16:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.83,0:17:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人知道 我尽快去找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one knows. I'll see you soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.50,0:17:04.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我爱你 爸爸 - 我也爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I love you, Daddy. - I love you too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.26,0:17:37.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,生日快乐 茜瑟！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happy birthday, Heather!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.06,0:17:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,许个愿吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make a wish!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.46,0:17:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,「生日快乐 茜瑟」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Happy birthday, HEATHER"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.32,0:18:03.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,「生日快乐 茜瑟」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Happy birthday, HEATHER"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.25,0:18:05.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,「生日快乐 爱莉」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Happy birthday, ALESSA"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.60,0:18:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sharon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.64,0:18:36.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎伦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sharon!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.56,0:18:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,请帮助我 先生…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, sir…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.97,0:18:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎伦 等等！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sharon, wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.70,0:19:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 爸爸…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy, Daddy…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.40,0:19:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.84,0:19:16.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎伦 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sharon, wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.23,0:19:22.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎伦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sharon!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.28,0:19:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,离我远点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep away from me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.71,0:19:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没事的 - 不 怎么没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's okay. - No, it's not okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.37,0:19:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都有事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing is okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.73,0:19:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.88,0:19:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫道格拉斯·卡特兰 我是私家侦探\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Douglas Cartland, I'm a private investigator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.40,0:19:40.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想对我干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want from me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.21,0:19:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,别人付钱让我找人 有人想找你 莎伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm paid to find people. Someone wanted you found, Sharon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.67,0:19:46.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不叫那名字！- 你是莎伦·达·席尔瓦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's not my name! - You're Sharon Da Silva.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.36,0:19:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少你是这样叫你自己的 你离开波特兰后我就跟着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or at least you think you are. Tracked you down after you left Portland.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.94,0:19:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和哈利逃脱了警察 但是我找到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and Harry got away from the police, but I found you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.27,0:19:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲的所做所为…只是正当防卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}What my dad did there… That was self-defense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.85,0:19:56.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不关心哈利杀了谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care who Harry killed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.49,0:19:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是要帮你 - 退后！为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm trying to help. - Get back! Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.43,0:20:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我不知道我在为谁工作 但现在知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I didn't know who I was working for then, but I do now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.88,0:20:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们自称天佑会\N{\fnArial\fs30}They call themselves the Order of Valtiel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.38,0:20:08.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他们要找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they want you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.25,0:20:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你骗我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're lying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.72,0:20:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do not understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.82,0:20:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们知道你在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}They know where you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.22,0:20:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉了他们你的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told them where you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.94,0:20:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要来了 你得逃走\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're coming. You gotta get away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.74,0:20:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, I will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.51,0:20:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,离我远点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep away from me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.04,0:20:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲告诉你的事都不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything your dad ever told you was a lie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.34,0:20:28.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的！他告诉我的是事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck you! He told me the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.47,0:20:29.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,那为什么你都不记得小时候的事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know why you don't remember anything from your childhood?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.99,0:20:33.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,出了车祸 我妈妈死了 我失忆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was in a car crash. My mother died. I lost my memory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.78,0:20:36.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,错！从来就没有什么车祸\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! There was never any accident.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.29,0:20:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被困在一个叫寂静岭的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were trapped in a place called Silent Hill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.29,0:20:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你母亲救了你 她把你救了出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But your mother saved you. She got you out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.14,0:20:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他们想让你回去 问问你爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they want you back. Ask your dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.10,0:20:46.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knows that…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.04,0:21:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我我是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me who I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.34,0:21:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.22,0:21:09.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please tell me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.35,0:21:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.27,0:21:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他走了 他走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gone. It's gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.89,0:21:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来帮你 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll help you, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.94,0:22:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,「垃圾」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Garbage"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.38,0:23:12.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个 退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two, move back now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.03,0:23:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,小姐 你不能呆在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Miss, you can't be back here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.18,0:23:18.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 麻烦到警戒线外面去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, back behind the tape, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.24,0:23:22.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 大家都往后站 大家都退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey come on, folks, I need you back, everybody get back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.83,0:23:26.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, whoa, one second.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.25,0:23:28.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的口袋里有一只皮夹\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a wallet in his pocket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.72,0:23:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 请往后站\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, please stand back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.29,0:23:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,道格拉斯·卡特兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Douglas Cartland.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.26,0:23:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,几张镇外的发票\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some P.I. from out of town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.24,0:23:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你发现了什么？- 孩子们发现了这件夹克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you got there? - The boys found this jacket down there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.40,0:23:43.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 上面有血迹 - 直接拿到物证中心去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There's blood on it. - Go hand it over to forensics, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.30,0:23:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看上面是谁的血迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}just find out whose blood it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.88,0:23:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,海瑟·曼森 莎伦·达·席尔瓦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heather Mason, Sharon Da Silva.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.99,0:23:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这女孩吗？- 可能就是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This girl? - Maybe this is her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.10,0:23:53.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,找她并问下卡特兰的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}See what we got on this Cartland, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.58,0:23:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,把监控带子调出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}pull the security tapes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.70,0:23:56.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要看看这儿今晚发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to see what happened here tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.14,0:23:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.59,0:24:00.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们发现那死了个人 你看见了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}They found a guy dead in there, did you see it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.71,0:24:03.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, uhh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.57,0:24:08.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.79,0:24:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不可以说出来 - 没事的 和我说说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can't tell you. - It's okay. You can tell me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.48,0:24:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 我现在好混乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I can't, because, I have no idea what's going on in my head now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.70,0:24:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利的语音信箱：是我 请留言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harry's voice on phone: It's me. Leave a message.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.32,0:24:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 你听到留言的话给我打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, dad, call me when you get this, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.78,0:24:30.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,天有点冷啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you're cold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.61,0:24:32.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的外套呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's your coat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.12,0:24:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,快披上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.06,0:24:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.42,0:24:42.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.21,0:24:46.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能看到吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you see them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.14,0:24:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 啊 谁啊 跑步那个？- 不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, who, the runner? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.69,0:25:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 那看来我真的有点晕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never mind. It's just another thing that prove that I'm going crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.72,0:25:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那 你家在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, where's home?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.98,0:25:10.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,在几街区以外\N{\fnArial\fs30}A couple of blocks away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.66,0:25:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我问的是之前 你是从哪搬来的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I mean before. Where did you come from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.58,0:25:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,没哪 真的 我和我爸爸一直都在换地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nowhere, really. I travel a lot with my dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.10,0:25:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得梦境和现实之间有区别吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think there is a difference between dreams and reality?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.80,0:25:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么这么和人聊天啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to the small-talk?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.89,0:25:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,「你用Facebook吗」这些吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No "what's your favourite band", "do you Facebook", nothing like that?…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.44,0:25:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Facebook是个屁 你用那玩意？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck Facebook. Do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.27,0:25:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没想过用那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never think about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.52,0:25:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 大家都想着玩那个 - 我可没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Everybody thinks about it. - Not me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.65,0:25:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的生命也够坎坷的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, my life is complicated enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.18,0:25:53.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该和我祖父聊聊 他总是想着这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should talk to my grandfather. That's all he ever thinks about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.15,0:25:55.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他都着了魔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It drove him crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.08,0:25:59.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我也着了魔了 - 不 不 我是说他疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's driving me crazy. - No, No, I mean he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.15,0:26:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,精神失常\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bat-shit nuts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.27,0:26:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他回到了我那又小又甜蜜的家乡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back in my sweet, little hometown, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.75,0:26:07.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,利昂那多老头 就在他软垫病房里胡说八道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Old man Leonard drools in a padded cell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.77,0:26:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会告诉你从来就没有梦这东西 只有无尽的一层盖着一层的事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will tell you there are no such things as dreams, just endless realities all piled on top of each other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.66,0:26:17.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些人能看到怪物 而另一些人…看到的只是人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some people see monsters, Other people just see… people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.89,0:26:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们为什么要把他关起来？- 是我妈妈指控他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And they locked him up for that? - My mother had him committed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.12,0:26:27.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天 - 真的 她有点咄咄逼人 我妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jesus. - Yeah, she's kind of intimidating, my mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.40,0:26:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,幻想和现实之间并无界限\N{\fnArial\fs30}No difference between fantasy and reality.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.62,0:26:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我觉得我并不喜欢我的现实生活 - 你觉得谁会喜欢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't think I like my reality. - You think anyone does?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.65,0:26:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少我是 那个我认同的自己 至于你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least I'm, who I think I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.83,0:26:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 特别真实…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, pretty real…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.92,0:26:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,…还有 挺漂亮的\N{\fnArial\fs30}… and just, pretty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.18,0:27:05.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你搭讪的水平真烂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, a lousy pick up line.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.43,0:27:06.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,经常奏效么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does it often work?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.99,0:27:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前没试过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never tried it before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.68,0:27:10.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,效果不好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did it go down?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.43,0:27:12.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可是搭讪的大忌\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a crime against pick-up lines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.24,0:27:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你挺有趣的 茜瑟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're kind of funny, Heather.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.35,0:27:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你特别混乱 但是我不知道…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're pretty fucked up, but I don't know, I …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.59,0:27:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你其实应该很傻很天真\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you're goofy fun inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.05,0:27:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,很傻很天…能这么评价我也挺好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goofy fun… That would be nice for a change.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.14,0:27:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不说了 快到家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, this is my street.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.02,0:27:37.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你送我回来 - 有机会了我还会再送你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thanks for walking me back. - I'd like to do it again sometime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.85,0:27:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,文森特 你很好 但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vincent, you're nice, but…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.76,0:27:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但我不觉得你想了解我 - 我想\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't think you wanna know me. - I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.88,0:27:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.55,0:27:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会再给你打电话的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna call you later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.61,0:27:53.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可没给你号码\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't give you my number.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.80,0:27:55.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见啦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you around!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.41,0:28:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.91,0:28:05.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.95,0:28:11.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,「到寂静岭来」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"COME TO SILENT HILL"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.15,0:28:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.27,0:28:22.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.63,0:28:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.19,0:28:35.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.60,0:28:37.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.90,0:28:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,茜瑟 我是文森特 听见你在喊 没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heather, it's Vincent. I heard you yell. Is everything alright?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.22,0:29:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need your help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.09,0:29:02.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.93,0:29:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是血吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that blood?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.15,0:29:15.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你叫警察了吗？- 不能叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you call the police? - I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.91,0:29:17.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么不叫？他们能帮助你 - 就是不能叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why not? They can help. - I just can't!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.56,0:29:19.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 行吗？- 行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay? - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.04,0:29:25.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道寂静岭在哪吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, do you know where this Silent Hill is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.63,0:29:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 那是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.69,0:29:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我梦见的地方 我爸爸 他… 他警告过我绝对不能到那去\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's something that I dreamt about. My dad, he… He warned me never to go there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.67,0:29:36.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我认得那标记\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I know that symbol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.38,0:29:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.23,0:29:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把东西都收在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}He kept it all in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.47,0:29:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,「莎伦」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"SHARON"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.15,0:29:52.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是你妈妈么？- 我的养母 露丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is this your mom? - My adoptive mom, Rose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.90,0:29:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是被收养的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were adopted?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.27,0:29:56.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我不知道我的亲生父母是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I never knew my real parents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.54,0:30:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这些都是你写的吗？- 对…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you write all of these? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.81,0:30:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 知道那是什么吗？- 不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you know what that is? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.56,0:30:21.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来好像这边还有一块能组合在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like there's another side that fits in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.26,0:30:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,枪？你为什么要拿枪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}A gun? Why do you need a gun?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.25,0:30:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 曼森小姐 我们是警察 - 我还以为你没报警呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Miss Mason, it's the police. - I thought you said you didn't call.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.54,0:30:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我没有 - 那他们为什么在这？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I didn't. - Then why are they here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.34,0:30:39.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 发生了什么 茜瑟？- 我得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is going on, Heather? - I have to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.61,0:30:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是他们抓住我 我就再找不到我爸爸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they catch me, I'll never find my dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.40,0:30:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住你？为什么他们要抓你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Catch you? Why would they catch you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.93,0:30:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你干了什么？- 没什么！我什么也没干 我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What have you done? - Nothing! I didn't do anything, I swear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.18,0:30:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 帮帮我 - 你想让我怎么帮你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Help me. - What do you want me to do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.61,0:30:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 会开车吗？- 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can you drive? - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.57,0:30:53.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会开车 你会吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't drive. Can you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.56,0:31:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,桑提尼 过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Santini, come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.64,0:31:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是想找到充分的证据吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want a probable cause?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.94,0:31:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.11,0:31:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里到底发生了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell happened here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.36,0:31:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉是某个团伙组织的标志？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That look like a gang tag to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.39,0:31:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得不是 但我从没见过这样的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I've never seen anything like it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.72,0:31:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,给犯罪现场小组打电话 把他们叫来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call Crime Scene, get them down here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.11,0:31:28.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那女孩呢？- 她是凶杀嫌疑人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What about the girl? - She's a murder suspect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.23,0:31:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我亲爱的莎伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}"My dearest Sharon, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.85,0:31:58.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你读这封信的时候说明我已经出事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you are reading this then something has happened to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.59,0:32:01.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在只能靠自己了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're on your own now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.61,0:32:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,别试图找我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't try to find me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.33,0:32:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你去哪 都不要到寂静岭去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And whatever you do, don't go to Silent Hill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.13,0:32:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和你妈妈发誓要保证你的安全 但是我没做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promised your mother I'd keep you safe, but I failed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.32,0:32:12.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你觉得我们在躲避警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you think we're running from the police, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.67,0:32:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我两年前在波特兰杀了人\N{\fnArial\fs30}because of the man I killed in Portland two years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.89,0:32:20.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能永远保护她！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't protect her forever!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.09,0:32:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.45,0:32:25.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,但事实是…他不是简简单单的一个贼\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the truth is… He wasn't just a random thief.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.35,0:32:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,收拾你的东西 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your things, we're leaving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.16,0:32:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是被派来带你回寂静岭的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was sent to take you back to Silent Hill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.32,0:32:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是教会的成员 那些人想要你 他们需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a member of the Order. These people want you, they need you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.84,0:32:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道原因 但是他们会用尽一切办法把你拖回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know why, but they will do everything in their power just to draw you back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.89,0:32:38.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须反抗他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must resist it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.67,0:32:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我试着保护你的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried to keep you safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.62,0:32:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是从未故意向你撒谎 是不得不这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I never meant to lie to you, but I had to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.94,0:32:47.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会在我的笔记本里找到真相 我发现的所有东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll find the truth in my notebooks. As much as I could find out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.57,0:32:53.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你读了我所了解的东西之后 能知道你到底是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope that when you read what I learned, you can finally begin to understand who you really are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.93,0:32:56.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,原谅爸爸没有告诉你真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please forgive me for not telling you the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.25,0:32:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我是为了保护你才这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I did it to protect you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.06,0:33:00.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱你 莎伦「\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you, Sharon."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.40,0:33:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.16,0:33:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要停一下吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you wanna stop?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.02,0:33:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.91,0:33:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,书上说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does it say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.80,0:33:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,讲了很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}So much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.82,0:33:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他画的我都看的懂 但这太疯狂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know his writing, but this is crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.06,0:33:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面说：「寂静岭最初是罪犯的殖民地\N{\fnArial\fs30}It says, "Silent Hill was originally a prison colony, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.13,0:33:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,建在从印第安人手里抢来的土地上\N{\fnArial\fs30}built on ground taken from the native Indians.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.92,0:33:35.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们称作寂静灵魂之地「\N{\fnArial\fs30}They called it, The Place of the Silent Spirits".{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.28,0:33:38.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远都别在古老的印第安墓地上盖房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never build on the ancient Indian burial grounds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.49,0:33:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得大家都知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought everyone knew that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.04,0:33:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这上面还说：「有个叫天佑会的种族狂热者\N{\fnArial\fs30}It says here, "Religious zealots called the Order of Valtiel, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.99,0:33:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近的100年秘密地管理着镇子\N{\fnArial\fs30}secretly ran the town for the last 100 years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.28,0:33:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在等待一个孩子的降生 她将成为神灵的容器\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were waiting for a child to be born to be a vessel for their god.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.30,0:33:59.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,神将复活 重塑这个世界「\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who would then be resurrected and make the world anew."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.37,0:34:02.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来好像一个疯狂的末日邪教\N{\fnArial\fs30}It sounds like one of those crazy doomsday cults.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.70,0:34:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 确实是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Sounds like it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.94,0:34:10.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一篇新闻文章\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is a newspaper article.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.97,0:34:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,「煤矿火灾失控」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Fire in the coal mines got out of control"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.25,0:34:20.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,「整个地区都在燃烧 在地下深处 每个人都务必撤离」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The whole place is still burning, deep underground. Everyone had to leave."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.42,0:34:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我爸爸就是不相信那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad doesn't believe that, though.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.24,0:34:27.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不信？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.51,0:34:30.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说那个地方是被妖童的力量所诅咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}He says the town was cursed by the power of a demon child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.88,0:34:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,她叫爱莉 教会想要用火净化她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her name was Alessa. This Order tried to cleanse her with fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.80,0:34:38.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他们失败了 爱莉…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they failed. And Alessa's revenge{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.96,0:34:43.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,召唤了黑暗世界 满是令人害怕的生灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}was to summon a world of darkness, filled with terrifying creatures.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.15,0:34:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里说是她的「护卫和刽子手」\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one, it says, is her "guardian and executioner".{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.28,0:35:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得停下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.95,0:35:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 我想继续走 - 我很累\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, I want to keep going. - I'm tired.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.31,0:35:23.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得休息 你也要休息\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need rest, you need rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.59,0:35:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得他们会找到我们吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think they'll find us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.76,0:36:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后肯定有人能找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone will, eventually.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.69,0:36:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还有得走吗？- 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You think we're far? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.71,0:36:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 很接近那了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I think we're very close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.27,0:36:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我觉得你不该去…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I don't think you should go…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.37,0:36:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 我觉得你爸爸是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - I think your dad is right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.58,0:36:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你不应该去寂静岭\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think you should go to Silent Hill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.00,0:36:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得去找他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to find him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.00,0:36:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也读了他的笔记了 他想让你逃跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You read his notebooks. He wants you to run.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.35,0:36:18.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 文森特… - 不 听我说 那个教会要找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Vincent… - No, listen to me. The Order, they want you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.75,0:36:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想这就是他们带走哈利的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think that's why they took Harry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.09,0:36:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让你回来 - 我没有选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}- To make you come back. - I don't have a choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.00,0:36:29.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还不明白吗？- 我懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't you understand that? - I understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.65,0:36:32.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.81,0:36:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是不想你出事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just don't want anything to happen to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.63,0:37:22.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没睡？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't sleep?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.76,0:37:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.45,0:37:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能再往前走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't go any further.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.43,0:37:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经说过这个了 我得去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We already talked about this. I have to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.01,0:37:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么你就是不相信我？- 是为了我爸爸 你不会懂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why can't you just trust me? - It's for my dad. You don't understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.26,0:37:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我明白 - 不 你不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I do. - No, you don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.82,0:37:43.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么会懂？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.54,0:37:46.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我就是教会的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I am a child of the Order.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.68,0:37:50.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.22,0:37:52.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在寂静岭出生长大\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was born and raised in Silent Hill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.73,0:37:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被选择降生在这世界就是为了确保你的回归\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was chosen to come into this world, to make sure you return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.43,0:37:58.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.45,0:38:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 怎么可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that's not possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.58,0:38:03.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,教会被困在寂静岭了 笔记上都说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Order are trapped in Silent Hill. The notebook says so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.85,0:38:07.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,少数人饶幸逃出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is possible for a few to escape just for a while, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.17,0:38:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,但需历经苦难\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it requires, it requires sacrifice, and suffering.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.12,0:38:18.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是被选中的人！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have been chosen for this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.72,0:38:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么能这样对我？- 我这一生都被灌输\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How could you do this to me? - My whole life all I've been taught, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.08,0:38:25.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们每一个人都被灌输 爱莉是这世界的大恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}All that any of us have taught is that Alessa is the great evil of the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.92,0:38:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,她困住我们 她带来黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}She trapped us, she brings the darkness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.36,0:38:31.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有你…你是这罪恶的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you… you are part of that evil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.86,0:38:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我 我知道这不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I, I know that's not true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.34,0:38:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,在看到你之后 在和你度过这段时间之后 我知道你并不邪恶 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}After seeing you, after spending this time with you, I know you're not evil, I …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.68,0:38:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你是爱莉的一部分的话…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you are part of Alessa…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.83,0:38:44.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,…你就是纯洁的那部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you're the innocent part.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.93,0:38:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一直以来你都在撒谎 - 我必须这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Every step of the way, you lied. - I had to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.84,0:38:51.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们一直在盯着 保护他们在这世界上的灵魂 你看见过他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were watching, protecting their spirits into the world. You saw them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.21,0:38:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你把我爸爸带走的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You took my dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.53,0:38:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 那与我无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please believe me, I had nothing to do with that, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.35,0:38:57.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对不起 - 为什么要带走他 为什么不带走我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sorry. - Why take him, why not just take me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.97,0:39:00.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得心甘情愿回去才行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you have to return of your own free will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.23,0:39:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,带走他 他们知道你就会跟着去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taking him, they knew you'd follow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.67,0:39:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么会这么重要？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do I matter so much?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.34,0:39:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为爱莉不消失 教会没法获得自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because the Order can't be free until Alessa is gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.95,0:39:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的力量把教会困住 再次变成完全体之前她是打不败的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her power keeps them trapped, and she can't be destroyed until she's whole again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.33,0:39:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有了你才有可能 - 那我父亲呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You will make that happen. - What about my dad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.04,0:39:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他还活着吗？- 活着 但是活不长了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is he still alive? - Yes, but not for long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.39,0:39:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我母亲克劳迪娅 她一旦达到目的 就立刻让他死\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mother, Claudia, won't keep him alive after she has what she wants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.10,0:39:23.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他在哪？- 在镇地下的圣殿里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where is he? - In the sanctuary beneath the town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.58,0:39:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等等 茜瑟 别去… - 不行！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait, Heather, stop… - No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.15,0:39:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.30,0:39:32.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得找到另一半 只有这个方法才能救你父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to find the other half. It's the only way you'll be able to save your dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.41,0:39:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那一半在我祖父那\N{\fnArial\fs30}My grandfather has it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.56,0:39:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,精神病院的那个？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one in the asylum?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.79,0:39:41.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 里昂那多·沃尔夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Leonard Wolf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.40,0:39:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 太危险了 让我帮你吧 - 不！离我远点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's dangerous. Let me help you. - No! Get off of me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.05,0:39:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听我说！- 不…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Listen! - No…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.23,0:39:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么回事？- 黑暗力量来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is happening? - The Darkness is coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.59,0:39:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,茜瑟…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heather…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.12,0:39:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.26,0:40:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下！让它停下！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop! Make it stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.18,0:40:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是你干的 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You did this. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.98,0:40:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.04,0:40:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么能做到？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could it be me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.55,0:40:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你是爱莉的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you are part of Alessa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.14,0:40:37.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太靠近了 你的力量使黑暗力量穿越了结界的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're so close, you allowed the darkness to break through.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.30,0:40:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,文森特 到底怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vincent, what is going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.50,0:40:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.99,0:40:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,文森特！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vincent!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.45,0:42:28.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到寂静岭\N{\fnArial\fs30}WELCOME TO SILENT HILL{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.44,0:44:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,烧死女巫！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burn the Witch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.30,0:44:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不应该来这\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should not be here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.43,0:44:21.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会利用你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will use you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.07,0:44:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们都会受尽折磨的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will all suffer now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.04,0:44:26.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know who you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.72,0:44:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是他的母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're her mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.16,0:44:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱莉的母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alessa's mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.89,0:44:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么能让他们烧死她？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could you let them burn her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.55,0:44:39.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我爱她\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I loved her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.48,0:44:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的 小宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's alright, sweetheart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.00,0:44:46.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的 没关系的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. It's alright{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.36,0:44:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被欺骗了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was deceived.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.15,0:44:54.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从未想过让她受这样的痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never wanted this for her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.24,0:44:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱莉：你要把我带到哪去？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alessa: Where are you taking me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.34,0:44:58.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈！妈妈！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy! Mommy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.95,0:45:05.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱莉是特别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alessa was special.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.75,0:45:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是唯一一个能逃过火刑的孩子 这就是她被选中的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was the only one who could survive the fire, that's why she was chosen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.79,0:45:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.44,0:45:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这只是给予了我们诅咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it only led to our damnation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.07,0:45:21.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是自作自受\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all got what you deserved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.39,0:45:26.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我变成了恶魔的母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, and I became the mother of the demon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.84,0:45:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你是她的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you are her daughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.20,0:45:33.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.55,0:45:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱莉没有在火中丧生 但是她却承受了极大的痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alessa didn't die in the fire, but she suffered so much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.79,0:45:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那痛苦带来的只有愤怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}For pain was only matched by the rage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.13,0:45:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为那愤怒 她的力量在增加…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And with that rage, her powers grew…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.68,0:45:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,…超出了她的控制\N{\fnArial\fs30}… beyond all comprehension.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.09,0:45:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱莉知道自己内心仍存部分仁慈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alessa knew there was a part of her, that could still be free from pain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.85,0:46:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以她就把她最后的 纯洁的那部分灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}So she took that last, innocent part of her soul{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.08,0:46:07.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,安放在一个新生的孤儿身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}and placed it into a new born, orphan child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.96,0:46:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.48,0:46:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被秘密的带离这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were secretly taken from here, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.10,0:46:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,被一对不知情的 有爱心的夫妇抚养长大\N{\fnArial\fs30}to be raised by loving, but unaware parents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.75,0:46:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是爱莉唯一能感觉到爱的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the only part of Alessa that feels love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.27,0:46:34.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能够平息怨恨 你不应该回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have the balance of hate. You should never have come back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.21,0:46:37.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你的到来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because now you have given the order what they could never have…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.94,0:46:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,岂不是成全教会消灭爱莉和你\N{\fnArial\fs30}A way to destroy Alessa. And you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.36,0:46:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is my father?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.66,0:46:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非牺牲你自己 否则无法救回你父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is nothing you can do to save him without damning yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.20,0:46:50.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不在乎 告诉我你知道什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care. Just tell me what you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.61,0:46:58.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道黑暗力量要来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know the darkness is coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.20,0:47:05.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在外面很危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's safer to be inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.05,0:47:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.44,0:47:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.97,0:48:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.05,0:50:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.83,0:50:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.54,0:50:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.63,0:50:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.61,0:50:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来了 我来帮你！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here, I'll help you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.94,0:50:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么回事？- 快跑 她来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What happened? - Run, she's coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.25,0:50:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么来了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's coming?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.90,0:51:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！快跑！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.77,0:51:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是从哪来的？- 我走错路…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where did you come from? - I took a wrong turn…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.11,0:51:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,在雾里迷了路…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got lost in the fog…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.15,0:51:54.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,走！快点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.38,0:52:00.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.61,0:52:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.94,0:52:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.08,0:52:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.88,0:52:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我唯一的儿子…\N{\fnArial\fs30}My own son…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.09,0:52:45.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,母亲 求你了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mother, please…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.10,0:52:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,…背叛了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}… betrayed us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.90,0:52:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不是恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is not evil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.46,0:52:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的意志被她的黑暗侵蚀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mind is corrupted by her darkness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.98,0:53:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,将这项任务交予你这样的没经验的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were young to be given this task…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.66,0:53:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.19,0:53:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你创造了爱莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You created Alessa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.73,0:53:09.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑暗力量是将你的邪恶报应到我们身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}The darkness is your evil reflected back at us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.96,0:53:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她是无辜的 - 她是无辜的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She is innocent. - She is innocent?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.00,0:53:17.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你疯了 像你祖父一样你疯了 - 杀了他！烧死他！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You are insane, just as your grandfather is insane. - Kill him! Burn him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.56,0:53:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,折磨他！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make him suffer!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.60,0:53:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让神来审判他！- 不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let the God judge him! - No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.13,0:53:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You succeeded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.47,0:53:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然你疯了 但是你还是把她引回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even in your madness, you guided her back to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.17,0:53:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,换作我妹妹蕙莎 就做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}What my sister, Christabella, could not achieve, I shall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.84,0:53:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很快会得到救助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Salvation is at hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.13,0:53:46.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不会一直疯下去 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And a broken mind can be mended. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.41,0:53:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,母亲 求你别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mother, please don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.82,0:53:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他带到精神病院去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take him to the asylum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.35,0:53:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 给他治疗治疗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Cure him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.58,0:53:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.22,0:54:14.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,「溪港精神病院」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Brookhaven Asylum"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.74,0:54:16.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,里昂那多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leonard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.51,0:55:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,<i>你觉得还有别人知道吗？</i>\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think someone knows?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.03,0:55:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,<i>没有</i>\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.79,0:55:11.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,<i>没人知道</i>\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one knows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.89,0:55:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,<i>好的</i>\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.57,0:55:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,<i>我也爱你</i>\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.25,0:56:13.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,里昂那多·沃尔夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leonard Wolf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.49,0:56:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.13,0:56:22.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,S-12\N{\fnArial\fs30}S-12.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.88,0:56:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,S-12\N{\fnArial\fs30}S-12.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.53,0:59:20.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,里昂那多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leonard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.72,0:59:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.37,0:59:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 过来点 让我能摸到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please come, come closer, so, so I could touch you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.23,0:59:35.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.32,0:59:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是克劳迪娅送你来的吗？- 克劳迪娅？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did Claudia send you? - Claudia?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.31,0:59:41.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 - 不 是把你扔到这了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - No. She put you here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.36,0:59:45.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我女儿竟说我被黑暗力量侵蚀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My own daughter says that I'm corrupted by the darkness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.05,0:59:47.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说我是怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}She says that I'm a monster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.93,0:59:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,可她比我可严重多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's far worse than I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.43,0:59:55.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,她也被黑暗力量吞噬了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is also corrupted by the same darkness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.68,0:59:59.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我在找我的父亲 - 他失踪了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I am looking for my father. - Is he lost?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.01,1:00:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在寂静岭\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's in Silent Hill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.68,1:00:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,有好多寂静岭 你确定是我们这的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are many Silent Hills. Are you sure it's this one?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.13,1:00:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,文森特说你知道怎样…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vincent said you know how to…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.51,1:00:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,文森特 那个小叛徒…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vincent, that little traitor…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.04,1:00:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的亲人背叛了我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}My own flesh and blood turned against me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.31,1:00:15.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,听听 啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen. Ahh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.01,1:00:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可能能听到他被折磨的哭喊吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may be able to hear the cries of his torment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.84,1:00:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在这？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.08,1:00:25.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,要修复你的意志还有别的地方吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where else would you go to mend your mind?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.75,1:00:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,像你这样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like yours is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.10,1:00:29.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.76,1:00:34.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是…一项进行中的项目\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just… an ongoing project.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.73,1:00:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有一半这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have half of this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.73,1:00:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你能帮帮我吗？- 听着…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Will it help me? - Listen…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.66,1:00:44.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我瞎了 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm blind, child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.76,1:00:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看不到你那拿的是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot see what you have there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.55,1:00:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,请放到我手上 我会试试帮你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Place it in my hand and I will try to help you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.40,1:00:55.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,别害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be afraid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.10,1:00:57.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.68,1:01:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你知道这是什么 - 我是教会的主教\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know what it is. - I was the Master of the Order.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.45,1:01:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么会不知道梅特鲁纹章？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could I not know the Seal of Metatron?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.77,1:01:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,她从我这偷走 并带那个孩子逃走\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was stolen from me and used by her to escape with the child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.07,1:01:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有了它我们没法召唤神灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without it we cannot summon the god.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.22,1:01:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是把钥匙 那它能打开什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a key. What does it unlock?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.23,1:01:32.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,事物的本质\N{\fnArial\fs30}The true nature of things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.65,1:01:34.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要找到另一半\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to find the other half.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.16,1:01:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你已经找到了 另一半就是我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you've already found it. The other half is in me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.81,1:01:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么？不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing? No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.27,1:01:46.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.18,1:01:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.90,1:02:05.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在…我看到你的真面目了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now… I see the truth of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.20,1:02:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是恶魔！必须毁灭你！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a demon! You must be destroyed!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.54,1:02:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.65,1:03:40.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,两半合起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two halves coming together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.21,1:03:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,完整了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's complete.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.24,1:04:12.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱莉？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alessa?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.19,1:04:16.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能感觉到我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you feel me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.60,1:04:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我在这 对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I'm here, don't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.62,1:04:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我拿到了梅特鲁纹章\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I've got the Seal of Metatron.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.41,1:04:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁来帮帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody help me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.33,1:06:17.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.34,1:07:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,后退！后退！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back! Get back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.95,1:07:27.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有你！\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.47,1:07:30.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,后退！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.96,1:07:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小心！- 后退！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look out! - Get back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.92,1:07:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,照做！照做！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it! Do it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.27,1:08:55.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么才能找到我爸爸？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can I find my dad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.39,1:08:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 茜瑟 帮帮我 - 告诉我他在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Heather, help me. - Tell me where he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.06,1:09:04.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,在湖边公园下面的圣殿\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the sanctuary, beneath the amusement park.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.10,1:09:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can help you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.63,1:09:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.08,1:09:23.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,快！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.51,1:09:24.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我快着呢！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am hurrying!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.04,1:09:27.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.70,1:09:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,等下！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.97,1:09:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 茜瑟 等下 - 我们需要把刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Heather, stop. - We need a knife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.58,1:10:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么生活在这样的地方？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can you live like this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.96,1:10:26.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,和黑暗力量 这些怪物生活在一起？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This darkness, those creatures?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.95,1:10:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的世界就是这样子啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all I've ever known.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.88,1:10:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑暗力量现在应该衰落了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Darkness should have faded by now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.48,1:10:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么这样说？- 你离爱莉这么近\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why hasn't it? - You're so close to Alessa, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.91,1:10:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,两部分再次融合 就会改变世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}two halves coming together again, it's changing the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.90,1:10:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那会发生什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's gonna happen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.70,1:10:48.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这得看你\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's up to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.00,1:10:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,湖边公园就在那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lakeside Amusement Park is over there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.87,1:10:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是圣殿的入口了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the entrance to the sanctuary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.57,1:11:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得你能救他吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think you can save him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.48,1:11:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得试试 我爸爸不顾性命保护我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to try. My dad gave up his life to protect me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.52,1:11:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我觉得他更希望你别来这里 - 你怎么会知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I think he'd want you to leave. - You don't know that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.64,1:11:20.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他爱你的话 他不会想让你涉身险境的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he loved you, he wouldn't want you to be in any danger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.37,1:11:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你爱着某人 你知道你永远都不会放弃的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you love someone, you know that you will never give up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.91,1:12:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 等等！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.12,1:12:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,蹲下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.63,1:12:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看 - 是守卫吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look. - Are they soldiers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.40,1:12:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不完全是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.99,1:12:30.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把他们叫做「兄弟会」 教会最虔诚的教徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}We call them "the Brethren". The most devout servants of the Order.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.52,1:12:34.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到他们的面具了吗？他们呼吸不到黑暗的空气\N{\fnArial\fs30}See the masks? They won't breathe the air of the darkness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.50,1:12:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们觉得那会侵蚀他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They think it corrupts them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.18,1:12:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你能找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you find him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.07,1:12:47.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望能自由快乐的生活 这是我最憧憬的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope live free and happy, It's more than I ever did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.66,1:12:50.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.88,1:12:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,文森特 不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vincent, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.34,1:14:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爱莉？- 女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Alessa? - Daughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.41,1:14:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.63,1:14:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我自己 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Self. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.09,1:14:48.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给了你生命 你才活得如我所愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gave you life so you could live my dream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.61,1:14:51.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我不受痛苦束缚的部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the part of me that can be free of this pain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.97,1:14:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,活着 感受爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Live, and feel love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.18,1:14:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么都感觉不到吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you feel nothing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.73,1:14:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,只能感觉到恨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing but hate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.71,1:15:05.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说你是恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}They say you are a demon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.09,1:15:08.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们说的对 - 是你创造了这噩梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They are right. - You created this nightmare.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.60,1:15:12.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,寂静岭的每个人都有不同的噩梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone has a different nightmare in Silent Hill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.69,1:15:15.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我就是噩梦的源头 - 我要救我的爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I am theirs. - I have to save my father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.35,1:15:18.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是我爸爸 也不是你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not my father, or yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.90,1:15:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,祭品 必须得有\N{\fnArial\fs30}And sacrifices, have to be made.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.09,1:15:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,去死！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to hell!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.58,1:15:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,事到如今 你还不明白吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you see? We're already here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.30,1:15:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,可不由得你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're not welcome!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.83,1:15:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不是觉得 我不会毁了你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think, I won't destroy you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.44,1:15:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.77,1:15:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.64,1:15:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候取回我给你的一切了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time to take back what I gave you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.67,1:16:09.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.06,1:16:16.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是一体 茜瑟\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are one, Heather.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.96,1:18:11.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.71,1:18:13.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎伦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sharon!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.56,1:18:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sharon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.93,1:18:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别伤害她！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't hurt her!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.53,1:18:34.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想从我这得到什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want from me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.49,1:18:36.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你周围\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look around you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.56,1:18:38.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们的圣殿\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was our sanctuary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.76,1:18:43.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,远离黑暗力量的最后安全之地\N{\fnArial\fs30}A last, safe place from the darkness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.11,1:18:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,可现在 即使在这 也陷入了她的罪恶之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now, even here, has fallen to her evil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.57,1:18:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是感谢神灵 你最后还是到达了这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}But praise the god, that you are here, finally.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.25,1:18:56.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你解救了我们 - 我没为你们做任何事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You have delivered us. - I have done nothing for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.92,1:18:59.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你完成了一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have done everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.38,1:19:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,打败了阿丽萨 合并了纹章\N{\fnArial\fs30}Defeated Alyssa. Re-joined the seal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.75,1:19:05.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是救世主\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are the savior.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.20,1:19:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我做了这么多事\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I've done so much, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.92,1:19:20.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就把我父亲放了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then let my father go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.31,1:19:27.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不能走 他的血将滋养新生的神灵…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He cannot go. His blood will feed the newborn god …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.26,1:19:32.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,而神灵将从你的身体里重生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just as your body will be its incubator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.17,1:19:34.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.43,1:19:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么是我？- 那就是你的命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why me? - It is your destiny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.92,1:19:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,许多年前你就被选为容器\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have been chosen many years ago to be the vessel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.48,1:19:46.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,神灵只能从你的血肉中重生\N{\fnArial\fs30}The god can only be born through your flesh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.93,1:19:50.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样我们就能从这牢狱中自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then we will be free from this prison{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.58,1:19:53.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,清洗这世上的罪恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}to cleanse the world of its sins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.55,1:20:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要…你的身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}And all we need… is your body.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.12,1:20:05.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.89,1:20:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你放她走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You leave her alone!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.49,1:20:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经拿到了梅特鲁纹章 有了它我就能召唤神灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have the Seal of Metatron. With it, I can summon the god.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.28,1:20:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give it to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.85,1:20:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着吧 我想看看你到底是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it, I want to see the truth of what you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.14,1:21:25.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爸爸！- 莎伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dad! - Sharon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.26,1:23:05.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,看灰烬…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ash…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.29,1:23:07.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经不再下了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's stopped!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.85,1:23:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是你做的吗？- 不 不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Was it you? - No, it's not me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.27,1:23:16.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想从现在开始这的一切就会不一样了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think things are gonna be different around here from now on…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.22,1:23:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,教会的力量已经不存在了 爱莉的噩梦结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Order's power is broken. Alessa's nightmare is over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.33,1:23:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她死了 - 会有第二个爱莉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's gone. - Another one will come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.99,1:23:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是迷失灵魂的归宿\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the place of lost souls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.90,1:23:33.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.32,1:23:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不能走 - 为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can't leave. - Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.11,1:23:43.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我得留在这 - 但是爸爸 我们已经自由了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I have to stay here. - But dad, we're free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.59,1:23:45.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们安全了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.22,1:23:48.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 第一次获得了自由 - 我得去找你的妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}- For the first time. - I'm gonna find your mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.08,1:23:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你救了我的命 我无所回报\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saved my life. And I can never repay you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.50,1:23:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是露丝还陷在某处\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Rose is still trapped here somewhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.57,1:23:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我得去找她 - 我来帮你找吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm gonna find her. - Let me help you find her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.17,1:24:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我答应过你妈妈 一旦你安全了 我就会回去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I promised her, once you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.84,1:24:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的任务 你已经完成了你该做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my task. You've done what you had to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.78,1:24:12.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 我想你获得完全的自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I want you to be free, finally.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.68,1:24:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明白我为什么要这么做吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you understand why I have to do this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.12,1:24:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是爸爸最疼爱的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're everything I could've ever wished for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.31,1:24:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我爱你 宝贝 - 我也爱你 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I love you, baby. - I love you too, Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.99,1:24:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,文森特 照顾好我的女儿 知道了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vincent, look after my little girl, do you hear?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.75,1:24:49.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不觉得她需要我照顾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think she needs me for that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.96,1:25:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.57,1:25:30.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.79,1:26:03.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,进来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.18,1:26:04.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心脚下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch your step.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.96,1:26:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 不用谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thanks. - No problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.55,1:26:13.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,能遇到我是你们的运气 我很长时间没走这条路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're lucky I came by. I haven't been this way in a long time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.36,1:26:16.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 特拉维斯·格雷迪 - 文森特\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Travis Grady. - Vincent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.87,1:26:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 莎伦 - 很高兴见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sharon. - Nice to meet you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.23,1:26:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这对小恋人要到哪去？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So where're you two lovebirds headed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.52,1:26:26.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,带我们离开这越远越好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just take us as far away from here as you can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.15,1:26:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没错！- 懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Amen to that! - Got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.48,1:27:00.93,Note,0,0,0,0,,（阁下正离开寂静岭）
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.48,1:27:18.62,Note,0,0,0,0,,（欢迎来到寂静岭）
